    "24fbd667e56a6dd7": {
      "id": "24fbd667e56a6dd7",
      "text": "#### Card: (text output)\nDear callSign et al of Team Name, \nHope everyone is having a pleasant week. My teammates and I would like to cordially invite you to the above async debate round. With alternative start dates to include: \nYYMMDD @ hh:mm\nYYMMDD @ hh:mm\nIf the date above does not work for you, please reply with your preferred timelines and and our team will review the dates. Thank you for your consideration. \nWarmly, callSign et al. of Team Name\n",
      "description": "#### Card: (text output) Dear callSign et al of Team Name, Hope everyone is having a pleasant week. My teammates and I would like to cordially invite you to the above async debate round. With alternative start dates to include: YYMMDD @ hh:mm YYMMDD @ hh:mm If the date above does not work for you, please reply with your preferred timelines and and our team will review the dates. Thank you for your consideration. Warmly, callSign et al. of Team Name",
      "type": "text",
      "position": {
        "x": -6827,
        "y": -4153,
        "width": 582,
        "height": 600
      },
      "color": "#666dd5",
