    "c8159d0bddaa043b": {
      "id": "c8159d0bddaa043b",
      "text": "# messageID Details\n\nsenderID\nreceiverID\n\nmessageType\n- `LINKED_PlayerToSupervisor`\n- `LINKED_SupervisorToPlayer`\n- `LINKED_PlayerToPlayer`\n- `ASKING_PlayerToTeamFounder` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class\n- `ASKING_TeamFounderToPlayer` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class\n- `LINKED_TeamMateToTeamFounder`\n- `LINKED_TeamFounderToTeamMate`\n- `ASKING_TeamToEnabler`\n- `RESPONDING_EnablerToTeam` (only as a response)\n- `ASKING_EnablerToEnabler`\n\n\nrelatedActivityID\ntimestamp\nmessageContent\nreplyToMessageID\n\nattachment\n\nisDelivered for sender\nisRead for receiver\nexpiryDate\n\nstatus (active, archived, deleted)\n\nautomatically expires (i.e., on the 15th day) and deleted unless the message is active or has been archieved within 14 days. \n",
      "description": "# messageID Details senderID receiverID messageType - `LINKED_PlayerToSupervisor` - `LINKED_SupervisorToPlayer` - `LINKED_PlayerToPlayer` - `ASKING_PlayerToTeamFounder` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class - `ASKING_TeamFounderToPlayer` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class - `LINKED_TeamMateToTeamFounder` - `LINKED_TeamFounderToTeamMate` - `ASKING_TeamToEnabler` - `RESPONDING_EnablerToTeam` (only as a response) - `ASKING_EnablerToEnabler` relatedActivityID timestamp messageContent replyToMessageID attachment isDelivered for sender isRead for receiver expiryDate status (active, archived, deleted) automatically expires (i.e., on the 15th day) and deleted unless the message is active or has been archieved within 14 days.",
      "type": "text",
